;----------------------------------------------------------------
; RESEARCH FAILURE FAIRNESS BACKOFF
;
; A failed Blacksmith research action leaves the technology at
; research-available. The watchdog records that technology here for a
; bounded 30-second exclusion so another eligible research claim can own the
; shared research mutex. This is fairness state, not a retry scheduler.
; RESEARCH FAILURE FAIRNESS BACKOFF
; Each research capability owns its own bounded failed-start exclusion.

(defrule
    (timer-triggered bt-research-town-center-failure-backoff-timer)
=>
    (disable-timer bt-research-town-center-failure-backoff-timer)
    (set-goal bt-research-town-center-failure-backoff-goal 0)
)

